Usage: pgrep [OPTION]... PATTERN

Look up processes by name or command line.
The current pgrep process is excluded from matches.

OPTIONS:
  -f, --full         match against full command line
  -i, --ignore-case  match case insensitively
  -l, --list-name    list PID and process name
  -a, --list-full    list PID and full command line
  -x, --exact        match the whole name or command line
  -c, --count        print only a count of matching processes
      --help         display this help and exit
  -V, --version      output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
